'''Jerrott Michael Willard''' (born July 11, 1972) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[Kansas City Chiefs]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[California Golden Bears football|California Golden Bears]]. He played in one game for the Chiefs in 1998.
